# A5 part 1: no_above and Ecerinis's topic (v2 tokens)

Settings: no_above = 0.5 (baseline), 0.8, 1.0, and 1.0 with TF-IDF weighting (count × log2(11 / plays containing the word), no length normalization). **TF-IDF was added because at 1.0 a few very frequent words (manus, scelus, magnus, deus, regnum) dominate every topic.** keep_n was not used: it keeps the most frequent words. Under TF-IDF a word in all 11 plays gets weight 0, so it acts like no_above just below 1.0 plus down-weighting of the other common words.

Seeds 0–49; k = 7–9 scored. The 0.5 baseline reproduces the A2 v2 trade-offs (largest difference 3.1e-04).

| setting | vocabulary | Ecerinis tokens (or weight) in the model input |
|---|---|---|
| 0.5 | 1,600 | 416 |
| 0.8 | 2,179 | 788 |
| 1.0 | 2,728 | 1,990 |
| 1.0+tfidf | 2,523 | 1,046 |

